<div id="about" class="container">
    <h1>About Task Tracker</h1>
    <p>Task Tracker is a simple web application that helps you manage your tasks and track the time spent on them. You can add tasks, start and stop timers for each task, and view statistics for your daily, weekly, and monthly time spent.</p>
    <p>This application is built using Node.js, Express, and EJS for the frontend. It uses JWT for authentication and provides a user-friendly interface to manage your tasks efficiently.</p>
    <p>Feel free to explore the features and improve your productivity!</p>
</div>